    "title": "Tumwater City Council adopts food systems plan - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jerome Tuaño ,\n5 hours ago The Tumwater City Council passed a resolution to adopt a food systems plan at a meeting on Monday, Nov. 3. The plan is intended to guide the city in implementing strategies addressing food insecurity. It analyzes current conditions of the city’s food system and outlines approaches for overcoming challenges faced by various sectors involved with food. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
